    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt offer for sale this comfortable three bed two bath family home in the Ard na Mara Development providing only for 23 homes in this quiet cul de sac. This home provides an excellent opportunity for a purchaser to acquire a well maintained starter home or equally a superb investment property. Kindly note this property has not been rented in recent years and the market rent can be set if required by the new owners. This home equally is conveniently located to commute to a number of surrounding centres via the nearby N25 Cork - Waterford Euroroute. The property benefits from bright airy accommodation which can be appreciated on inspection.\n\nViewing is strictly by prior appointment with Sole Selling Agents REA Spratt in Dungarvan 058-42211 or info@spratt.ie. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\n4.80m x 1.90m Tiled floor, wc/whb off\n\nWC\n1.60m x 1.50m Tiled floor\n\nSitting Room\n6.67m x 3.00m Timber floor, open fire having recessed stove\n3 kilowatt, bay window overlooking shared lawned open space\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Area\n5.00m x 3.90m Generous selection of fitted kitchen units incorporating a number of integrated appliances. Island incorporating hob. Tiled floor with doors to walled rear garden\n\nBedroom 1\n4.90m x 3.90m Generous in size, carpet floor with alcove off suitable for built in wardrobes. Ensuite off\n\nEn-suite\n2.30m x 1.55m Triton T90CR Electric Shower\n\nBedroom 2\n4.00m x 2.70m Carpet floor\n\nBedroom 3\n2.90m x 2.15m Carpet floor\n\nBathroom\n2.00m x 1.80m Full bathroom suite with tiled bath surround\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Pleasant walled corner site with private side pedestrian access.\nMaster bedroom ensuite.\nPatio doors leading to rear garden.\nVacant and early close of sale can be accommodated.\nRear garden nicely landscaped incorporating raised beds, paving and garden shed.\nOff street parking.\nShort stroll to Youghal Town Centre.\nEasy access to the N25 and onwards to Cork City.\nAll floor coverings, all light fittings, all window furnishings and integrated appliances. \n All Mains Services to include water and sewerage.\nOil fired central heating (new Greenpack condenser boiler).\nNew recessed wood burning stove installed."
      },
      {
